#: scenario8:scenario8_81A09D56_1B8C_4CD2_905C_DB402E7A3EA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f680fa289598be34e6eefd1b4bda95c1765f19c13d3ae9fe4b338c5940e8d1f9
