msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I don’t think he has the spine for it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...je ne pense pas qu’il en ait le cran."

#: scenario8:scenario8_83225998_CFAD_4684_8752_ADB0FCF8A1FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45430fb054c32c28168ce35ac875a15d577030bd8da718f21c0bc95ac181af71
#. default-sha256: 57e7f5da2f3188099f794685bea4e0889f82316b3abcbe41d00fc14a9fbe2b84
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_83225998_CFAD_4684_8752_ADB0FCF8A1FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Did you ever have a chance... ⟪k:3⟫to see the shadows trapped in the mansion?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Avez-vous déjà eu l’occasion... ⟪k:3⟫de voir les ombres piégées dans le manoir ?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AB0BAADD_89E6_44F7_93C5_40473ED2B1D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 042bc6dad84863e0a9112adebfdec9988797213bd7ef6884de4ef2327cafa856
#. default-sha256: cc4ffab2b0fb356db034088616f4435df7ef9993b741d90b91cdb078f6327f7e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AB0BAADD_89E6_44F7_93C5_40473ED2B1D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I... ⟪k:3⟫I might have.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫But around the time Hayden Rhodes passed away..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫P...⟪k:3⟫Peut-être bien.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Mais à partir du moment où Hayden Rhodes s’est "
"éteint..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dab838f62a6f10f9a919ffdd4827c541407e5c120a7c006944be4be5fd8f237b
#. default-sha256: 0a0d21018510b6719d2811b45f8c1a1f4e86cf757be9f2ee250996d604d54479
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had become... ⟪k:3⟫merely another part of the cursed mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫J’étais devenue... ⟪k:3⟫simplement une autre partie de ce manoir maudit."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1da634c89312cb3ff49e350989286336f094ddf2afff436c4dc502723ae768a3
#. default-sha256: 04e0beb5cc6111555d10c20e788ac8d6f561f9924b94ab9677977b9448d9e921
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I suppose, much like the rules differ between the realms of the living and the dead, ⟪k:1⟫"
"so too do they differ for those who have lost their grip on reality.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Je suppose que si les règles qui régissent le royaume des vivants et celui des morts "
"divergent, ⟪k:1⟫il en va de même pour ceux qui ont perdu tout lien avec la réalité.)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8904f99227877d7861541b27f24c546b884beb17bc752a22e039d26260b0a7bb
#. default-sha256: b70f4ebfbe48979108f72388cfd17cfff5afb86218176c39cb54626329fb468d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Someone else is holding the reins.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫My first guess would be the lord, but "
"regardless..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quelqu’un d’autre doit tenir les rênes.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫À⟪k:5⟫ mon avis, c’est le "
"seigneur mais quoi qu’il en soit..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_30E84B6F_8F74_4AF0_ADDC_808EFDF1312A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de8b35ee4ddf0b38b47d1ac69526833b1606b030d424bb12bfac335516f41c04
#. default-sha256: e0d2fa94fea33ff81cec372507d204e723edb79cfbb121b04cc795377255278d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_30E84B6F_8F74_4AF0_ADDC_808EFDF1312A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫they are not equals in this endeavor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...ils ne sont pas égaux dans cette entreprise."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f29788805e25db5e71e19ad9939b1cfc9eb6738b455f8393129edf330f011a1
#. default-sha256: 99f32bd50bd1778f656575a60e4c03848283501a17086ad22442b016b1a3421b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If he wants out, then maybe he would have agreed to help if we told him we’re here "
"to save Morgana."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫S’il veut s’en sortir, alors on n’avait qu’à lui dire qu’on était là pour sauver "
"Morgana et il aurait peut-être accepté de nous aider."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6737e92de47da9decff04f4b27ee079fb73354fb65e024ca72289ddbad742a9
#. default-sha256: 42d747d6fd992a33ddc3d43e061a27aec434b20c28de262a5eaac5039aa96fec
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re right, we do.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We know things we should have no way of knowing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oui, vous avez raison.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Nous savons des choses qui sont normalement "
"impossibles à connaître."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2226f7cd9f26d5ca942b8a9ed54841e85951d8cf0a75a4596ecf3089692792d7
#. default-sha256: 114b4c76011c6bdec21ba7539a782d7712e410e9efd064de95e0aa740f125b43
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They each have their reasons for locking Morgana up,⟪k:3⟫and if I’m right, they’re "
"doing it for other people.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’s these powerful bonds driving them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ils ont chacun leurs raisons pour enfermer Morgana,⟪k:3⟫et à moins que je ne me "
"trompe, ils le font pour d’autres personnes.⟪k:4⟫ Ce sont ces liens puissants qui les motivent."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9122ef7ef2eb6803d8befed26e798381befbb5ed99522d65aeff8df471abacd9
#. default-sha256: ea12e75e0358aceef2d91ae4bdf6eb38108810bc2986a202db8810f5655b5ac9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Are they mere bonds, or is it fate that ties them together?)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Est-ce que ce sont de simples liens, ou bien est-ce le destin qui les a réunis ?)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_95D11894_E9D5_4C48_887C_518C2C448366
